{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16664","headline":"城南访裴氏昆季 · 李约","name":"城南访裴氏昆季","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"相思起中夜，夙驾访柴荆。\n早雾桑柘隐，晓光溪涧明。\n村蹊嵩棘间，往往断新耕。\n贫野烟火微，昼无乌鸢声。\n田头逢饷人，道君南山行。\n南山千里峰，尽是相思情。\n野老无拜揖，村童多躶形。\n相呼看车马，颜色喜相惊。\n荒圃鸡豚乐，雨墙禾莠生。\n欲君知我来，壁上空书名。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李约","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16664.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16664","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}